OL,3,GNEWSADrones are 'without doubt the
OL,4,Afuture of policing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrones have been described a "the
OL,7,Ffuture of policing" after they were
OL,8,Fused to help seize 130 illegal off-road
OL,9,Fbikes across north Manchester in the
OL,10,Fless than a year.
OL,12,FThe fleet of drones is being used by
OL,13,FGreater Manchester Police instead of
OL,14,Fthe force helicopter because drones are
OL,15,Fcheaper to use and more discreet.
OL,17,FInsp Dan Pickavance, from GMP's North
OL,18,FManchester Neighbourhood Policing Team,
OL,19,Fsaid: "All police forces can use drones
OL,20,F- particularly in urban areas - and it
OL,21,Fmeans we can safely take illegal
OL,22,Foff-road bikes off the streets.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
